      "initialText": "Field Kiln\nOBJECTS FOR EVERY DAY\nA fictional ceramics studio\nThe collection ↗\n\nCOLLECTION / TABLE & TEA / EVERYDAY TEAPOT\n\nNO. 014 / TABLE & TEA\n650 ML\nA quiet companion to the daily ritual.\n01 — 01\n\nOriginal vector illustration of a fictional sample product. Not a photograph; shown in Iron.\n\nMADE FOR THE MOMENTS BETWEEN\n\nEveryday\nTeapot\n$68 USD\nGlazed stoneware · 650 ml\n\nA rounded form, a generous handle, a reason to pause. A handmade ceramic teapot for your everyday tea ritual.\n\n01 Choose your glaze\nIron\nAsh\nUnavailable\nSand\n\nIron · 4 available\n\n02 Quantity\n1\n2\n3\n4\nPieces (1 × $68)\n$68\nDomestic shipping\n$8\nTotal USD\n$76\nAdd to simulated cart\n↗\n\nA sample shopping experience. No payment or real order.\n\nKNOW YOUR PIECE\n\nSimple form.\nThoughtful details.\n\n01 / THE PIECE\n\nMade to be held\nMaterial\nGlazed stoneware\nCapacity\n650 ml\nDimensions\n16 cm wide × 12 cm high\n\n02 / THE CARE\n\nA little care, daily\n\nHand wash. Avoid sudden temperature changes. Not for stovetop use.\n\n03 / TO YOUR TABLE\n\nDelivery & returns\n\n$8 domestic shipping per order. Dispatch in 2 business days; illustrative domestic transit 3–5 business days.\n\nUnused pieces accepted within 30 days. Customer pays return shipping; original shipping is nonrefundable.\n\nField Kiln\n\nFictional shop and illustrative product, price, stock, delivery, and returns.\n\nFOR THE EVERYDAY.",
